  "transcript": [
    {
      "turn": 0,
      "role": "patient",
      "text": "Alright, doctor. My stomach's been playing up."
    },
    {
      "turn": 1,
      "role": "interviewer",
      "text": "Can you tell me more about how your stomach feels? For example, is it painful, bloated, or does it feel like it's twisting?"
    },
    {
      "turn": 1,
      "role": "patient",
      "text": "It's a burning pain in the upper middle of my tummy, about 5 out of 10. It gets worse an hour after meals and sometimes at night. I feel sick after eating and bloated, but I haven't thrown up.",
      "gate_selected_fact_ids": [
        "f03",
        "f04"
      ]
    },
    {
      "turn": 2,
      "role": "interviewer",
      "text": "Does this pain ever feel like it's spreading to your back or shoulders?"
    },
    {
      "turn": 2,
      "role": "patient",
      "text": "No, it doesn't spread to my back or shoulders. It stays in my upper middle tummy.",
      "gate_selected_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "turn": 3,
      "role": "interviewer",
      "text": "Have you noticed any changes in your bowel movements, like diarrhea, constipation, or black, tarry stools?"
    },
    {
      "turn": 3,
      "role": "patient",
      "text": "I passed black, sticky, smelly stools twice this week. I haven't had diarrhea or constipation, just those stools.",
      "gate_selected_fact_ids": [
        "f05"
      ]
    },
    {
      "turn": 4,
      "role": "interviewer",
      "text": "Have you been taking any medications, supplements, or herbal remedies recently?"
    },
    {
      "turn": 4,
      "role": "patient",
      "text": "I've been taking ibuprofen 400 mg three times a day for my knee, and I chew antacid tablets, which help a little.",
      "gate_selected_fact_ids": [
        "f08"
      ]
    },
    {
      "turn": 5,
      "role": "interviewer",
      "text": "Have you had any recent injuries, falls, or accidents that might have affected your abdomen?"
    },
    {
      "turn": 5,
      "role": "patient",
      "text": "No, I haven't had any recent injuries or accidents. I've been moving around okay, though my knee is still bothering me.",
      "gate_selected_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "turn": 6,
      "role": "interviewer",
      "text": "Have you experienced any weight loss, changes in appetite, or feeling unusually tired lately?"
    },
    {
      "turn": 6,
      "role": "patient",
      "text": "I've lost about 5 pounds in the last two months, but I'm not sure if it's from not eating much or just my body. I don't feel like eating much lately, and I do feel tired a lot.",
      "gate_selected_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "turn": 7,
      "role": "interviewer",
      "text": "Have you had any recent changes in your diet, such as eating more spicy, fatty, or acidic foods?"
    },
    {
      "turn": 7,
      "role": "patient",
      "text": "I think it's from spicy takeaways and stress at work. I've been eating more fatty foods lately, and I haven't been drinking enough water.",
      "gate_selected_fact_ids": [
        "f12"
      ]
    },
    {
      "turn": 8,
      "role": "interviewer",
      "text": "Have you noticed any improvement or worsening of symptoms when you avoid spicy or fatty foods?"
    },
    {
      "turn": 8,
      "role": "patient",
      "text": "I haven't tried avoiding spicy or fatty foods yet, but I think it might help. I'm not sure how to track it properly.",
      "gate_selected_fact_ids": [
        "f12"
      ]
    },
    {
      "turn": 9,
      "role": "interviewer",
      "text": "Have you had any recent changes in your sleep patterns or stress levels?"
    },
    {
      "turn": 9,
      "role": "patient",
      "text": "I've been sleeping worse than usual, maybe because of the stress at work. I'm not getting enough rest, and it's making me feel even more tired.",
      "gate_selected_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "turn": 10,
      "role": "interviewer",
      "text": "Have you had any other symptoms, such as heartburn, nausea, or a feeling of fullness even after eating small amounts?"
    },
    {
      "turn": 10,
      "role": "patient",
      "text": "I feel a burning in my chest, like heartburn, especially after eating. I also feel full even after just a little food, and I get that sick feeling again.",
      "gate_selected_fact_ids": [
        "f04"
      ]
    },
    {
      "turn": 11,
      "role": "interviewer",
      "text": "Have you noticed any blood in your stool or dark, tarry stools that look like coffee grounds?"
    },
    {
      "turn": 11,
      "role": "patient",
      "text": "I passed black, sticky, smelly stools twice this week. I don't think there was any blood in them, but I'm not sure.",
      "gate_selected_fact_ids": [
        "f05"
      ]
    },
    {
      "turn": 12,
      "role": "interviewer",
      "text": "Have you had any other symptoms, such as vomiting, dizziness, or fainting?"
    },
    {
      "turn": 12,
      "role": "patient",
      "text": "I feel dizzy when I stand up quickly, and it's been happening for the past few days. I haven't vomited.",
      "gate_selected_fact_ids": [
        "f04",
        "f06"
      ]
    },
    {
      "turn": 13,
      "role": "interviewer",
      "text": "Have you had any recent changes in your medication, or have you started any new medications, supplements, or herbal remedies?"
    },
    {
      "turn": 13,
      "role": "patient",
      "text": "No, I haven't changed my medications. I've just been taking ibuprofen and antacids as usual.",
      "gate_selected_fact_ids": [
        "f08"
      ]
    },
    {
      "turn": 14,
      "role": "interviewer",
      "text": "Have you had any recent changes in your activity level, such as starting or stopping exercise, or have you been feeling more fatigued than usual?"
    },
    {
      "turn": 14,
      "role": "patient",
      "text": "I've been less active because my knee hurts a lot. I'm not able to walk as much as before, and I feel more tired than usual.",
      "gate_selected_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "turn": 15,
      "role": "interviewer",
      "text": "Have you had any recent changes in your weight, appetite, or energy levels that might be related to your symptoms?  \n\n[HISTORY COMPLETE]"
    }
  ],
